= Paul Levi

Levi is a former leader of the NSPD who resigned in protest over the election of the Communist Ernst Thälmann as Deputy Chairman.

- @building_the_left
- @nspd_cooperation
- @root: Return to main

@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the SPD to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 10; left_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent += 3

We have increased the strength of the left faction with the SPD. This raised concern among the moderate reformists in the party.

@nspd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the NSPD
subtitle: Any cooperation between the parties requires compromise from the NSPD as well as the SPD.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; nspd_relation += 6*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 3; communist_coalition += 1 if nspd_cooperation_seen <= 1; nspd_cooperation_seen += 1

Levi attempts to reach out to his former colleagues in the NSPD. Some concessions are extracted.
